window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-026-4ebc37987fdb1bd9.json"]={sha256:"4ebc37987fdb1bd9f950a0025bcb03e07cfe205e991625bcf18c9e9e92a91034",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-7d2d2923d453ec72","url":"https://github.com/linux-rdma/rdma-core","title":"rdma-core verbs interfaces","titleEn":"rdma-core verbs interfaces","publisher":"linux-rdma project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-026","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-026","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-027","referenceUrls":["https://docs.nvidia.com/networking-ethernet-software/cumulus-linux/Layer-3/Routing/Equal-Cost-Multipath-Load-Sharing/"],"title":"ECMP：少數大型流的雜湊偏斜","titleEn":"ECMP: hash imbalance with a small number of large flows","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付封包分解、尾包測例與層級定義；標示這是通用帳本，不是某 RDMA transport 完整封包格式；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver packet decomposition, tail-packet cases and layer definitions. Label this as a generic accounting exercise rather than the complete packet format of any particular RDMA transport. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立 flow_key、path_id、offered_rate；逐流聚合，保存雜湊鍵欄位與實際路徑結果，不假設相同 seed 跨版本相同。","differenceEn":"Record flow keys, assigned paths and offered rates. Aggregate by actual path and preserve the selected key fields; do not assume a seed produces identical assignments across implementations or software versions.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["封包數為 ceil(message_bytes/payload_limit)，總線上量為訊息量加封包數乘 overhead；最後一包可不滿載；訊息 1048576 B，每包額外 64 B；payload 上限由 4096 改為 1024 B，無重傳與填補；名義式 1048576+ceil(1048576/4096)*64 = 1064960 modeled wire B；變更式 1048576+ceil(1048576/1024)*64 = 1114112 modeled wire B。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","最忙路徑利用比為該路徑需求率除以容量；流不可分割時，平均流量不能替代實際指派後的最大值；六條流各 8 GB/s，兩條路徑各容量 20 GB/s；名義分配 5:1，變更 3:3；名義式 5*8/20 = 2 load/capacity；變更式 3*8/20 = 1.2 load/capacity。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Packet count is the ceiling of message bytes divided by payload limit. Modeled wire bytes equal message bytes plus packet count times fixed overhead; the final packet may carry less payload. Send a 1048576-byte message with a synthetic 64-byte overhead per packet. Payload limit changes from 4096 to 1024 bytes, excluding retransmissions, padding and other unmodeled link framing. Nominal 1048576+ceil(1048576/4096)*64 = 1064960 modeled wire B; changed 1048576+ceil(1048576/1024)*64 = 1114112 modeled wire B. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Busiest-path load ratio divides its offered rate by capacity. When flows are indivisible, average offered traffic cannot replace the maximum load after actual assignment. Use six flows of 8 GB/s and two paths of 20 GB/s each. Assignment changes from five flows versus one to three versus three; offered total remains 48 GB/s. Nominal 5*8/20 = 2 load/capacity; changed 3*8/20 = 1.2 load/capacity. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-036","referenceUrls":["https://docs.ceph.com/en/latest/rados/operations/crush-map/"],"title":"Ceph CRUSH：不同機架仍共用上游電源","titleEn":"Ceph CRUSH: distinct racks with a shared upstream power domain","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付封包分解、尾包測例與層級定義；標示這是通用帳本，不是某 RDMA transport 完整封包格式；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver packet decomposition, tail-packet cases and layer definitions. Label this as a generic accounting exercise rather than the complete packet format of any particular RDMA transport. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立 replica→rack 與 replica→power_domain 兩種關係；輸出此次事件的可用副本與不可用原因。","differenceEn":"Build separate replica-to-rack and replica-to-power-domain relations. Emit surviving replicas and explicit reasons for each unavailable copy, retaining both topology dimensions in the evidence.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["封包數為 ceil(message_bytes/payload_limit)，總線上量為訊息量加封包數乘 overhead；最後一包可不滿載；訊息 1048576 B，每包額外 64 B；payload 上限由 4096 改為 1024 B，無重傳與填補；名義式 1048576+ceil(1048576/4096)*64 = 1064960 modeled wire B；變更式 1048576+ceil(1048576/1024)*64 = 1114112 modeled wire B。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","給定故障事件集合，失去副本數為其電源祖先被事件覆蓋的副本基數；不是將每個中間節點重複計次；三個副本分三 rack；名義其中兩個依賴 PDU-A，變更只有一個依賴 A；此次僅使 A 失效；名義式 1+1+0 = 2 replicas unavailable；變更式 1+0+0 = 1 replicas unavailable。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Packet count is the ceiling of message bytes divided by payload limit. Modeled wire bytes equal message bytes plus packet count times fixed overhead; the final packet may carry less payload. Send a 1048576-byte message with a synthetic 64-byte overhead per packet. Payload limit changes from 4096 to 1024 bytes, excluding retransmissions, padding and other unmodeled link framing. Nominal 1048576+ceil(1048576/4096)*64 = 1064960 modeled wire B; changed 1048576+ceil(1048576/1024)*64 = 1114112 modeled wire B. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","For a specified failure event, lost replicas are those whose power ancestry intersects the failed domain set. Count replicas once, not every failed intermediate component along their dependency paths. Place three replicas in three racks. Initially two depend on PDU-A; after rewiring the synthetic dependency map, only one does. The modeled event removes PDU-A alone. Nominal 1+1+0 = 2 replicas unavailable; changed 1+0+0 = 1 replicas unavailable. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-b7a337ca69ad5153","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/networking-ethernet-software/cumulus-linux/Layer-3/Routing/Equal-Cost-Multipath-Load-Sharing/","title":"Equal Cost Multipath Load Sharing","titleEn":"Equal Cost Multipath Load Sharing","publisher":"NVIDIA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-3483988fac4024a6","url":"https://docs.ceph.com/en/latest/rados/operations/crush-map/","title":"CRUSH maps","titleEn":"CRUSH maps","publisher":"Ceph project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
